WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
Sister Siya, why don't you go get it and shut up?

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:10,980
Forget it, is there a knife inside?

3
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:11,940
No complete tool

4
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:12,980
But these metal buckles

5
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,340
Both needle thread and sealing tape can be used

6
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,860
This is much more valuable than a gesture

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,340
Now someone finally starts the case

8
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,180
Is it possible for me to live and pay for things?

9
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,860
Whoever finds it belongs to whoever finds it, don’t rob it.

10
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:22,900
Why

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,420
Because no one dared to go in just now

12
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,660
He took the risk and took it out

13
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:36,160
What if no one robs you?

14
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,840
Those who are not seen in your hands will have a share.
